\chapter{Program cohort access and examination results}

Two new capabilities allow the extraction of cohort-level data that
complements the existing per-student and per-course-round queries.

\begin{enumerate}
\item \textbf{Program cohort}: listing the students admitted to a
  \emph{program round} (\emph{utbildningstillfälle}) for a given
  admission semester (e.g.\ HT25 = autumn 2025).  In LADOK's internal
  terminology the enrolment is a
  \emph{kurspaketeringstillfälle} (course-package round), but it is
  identified by the program-round UID returned by the
  \texttt{utbildningsinformation} service.

\item \textbf{Examination occasion results}: listing every student
  registered for an \emph{aktivitetstillfälle} together with their
  reported result.
\end{enumerate}

These UIDs from the test environment are used in the tests below.
<<test [[api.py]]>>=
# CTFYS HT25 program round (utbildningsinformation service)
CTFYS_round_id  = "c651ef07-2031-11f0-a301-a2036b2340f3"
# SH1014 written exam on 2026-01-07 and its associated course round
SH1014_occasion_id = "01fe3c80-324b-11f0-8a2b-a6b448f445fa"
SH1014_round_id    = "9ade5891-bba7-11ef-9553-beecfac44351"
# Student with multiple SH1014/TEN1 attempts: first F (2025-01-07), then C (2026-01-07)
SH1014_retake_student_uid = "134e3c18-0e50-11ed-8f4d-87c157374df8"
@


\section{[[program_rounds_JSON]]}

To identify which program round corresponds to a given admission semester
we first need all rounds for a program code.  The
[[utbildningsinformation]] service provides this via a GET to the
[[utbildningstillfalle/filtrera]] endpoint.

Each item in the returned [[Resultat]] list includes:
\begin{description}
\item[[[Uid]]] The round's unique identifier, used to fetch participants.
\item[[[SammanslagenTillfallesperiod]]] Contains [[Startdatum]] and
  [[Slutdatum]] — used to identify the admission semester.
\item[[[Utbildningstillfalleskod]]] The short round code, e.g.\ [[OP116]].
\item[[[StartperiodID]]] An integer identifying the starting period.
\end{description}

The caller can filter the returned list by [[Startdatum]] to pick the
round for a particular semester (e.g.\ HT25 = month $\ge 7$ of year
2025).  We use [[_all_pages]] (\cref{Pagination}) so the full list is
returned regardless of how many programme rounds the code has had ---
no caller has to think about page numbers.

<<LadokSession data methods>>=
def program_rounds_JSON(self, program_code: str) -> list:
  """Return all programme rounds for a programme code.

  Each round contains 'Uid', 'SammanslagenTillfallesperiod',
  'Utbildningstillfalleskod', etc.  Filter by 'SammanslagenTillfallesperiod.
  Startdatum' to pick the round for a particular admission semester.
  """
  return self._all_pages(lambda page, limit: self.get_query(
    f"/utbildningsinformation/internal/utbildningstillfalle/filtrera"
    f"?utbildningskod={program_code}&sprakkod=sv"
    f"&page={page}&limit={limit}",
    "application/vnd.ladok-utbildningsinformation+json"
  ))
@

The test verifies that [[CTFYS_round_id]] appears among the returned
programme rounds.
<<test functions>>=
def test_program_rounds_JSON(ladok) -> None:
  rounds = ladok.program_rounds_JSON("CTFYS")
  assert len(rounds) > 0
  round_uids = [r["Uid"] for r in rounds]
  assert CTFYS_round_id in round_uids
@


\section{[[program_round_participants_JSON]]}

Given a program-round UID we fetch its participants from the
[[studiedeltagande]] service.  The endpoint path uses
[[kurspaketeringstillfalle]] (course-package round) — the internal
LADOK term for a programme-round enrolment — rather than
[[utbildningstillfalle]].  The caller supplies the UID returned by
[[program_rounds_JSON]].  Like that method we walk all pages with
[[_all_pages]] (\cref{Pagination}); a popular programme has hundreds
of admitted students per cohort and the default 400-per-page limit is
not always enough.

Each participant entry contains:
\begin{description}
\item[ [[Student]] ] Sub-object with [[Uid]], [[Fornamn]],
  [[Efternamn]], and [[Personnummer]].
\item[ [[TillstandKurspaketering]] ] Participation status codes, e.g.\
  [[pagaende]] (active), [[ej_paborjad]] (admitted, not yet started).
\item[ [[SummeradGodkandOmfattning]] ] Approved ECTS credits
  accumulated so far.
\end{description}
<<LadokSession data methods>>=
def program_round_participants_JSON(self, round_uid: str) -> list:
  """Return all participants enrolled in a programme round.

  round_uid is a UID from program_rounds_JSON.
  """
  return self._all_pages(lambda page, limit: self.get_query(
    f"/studiedeltagande/internal/deltagare/kurspaketeringstillfalle"
    f"/{round_uid}"
    f"?page={page}&limit={limit}"
    f"&orderby=NAMN_ASC&orderby=PERSONNUMMER_ASC",
    "application/vnd.ladok-studiedeltagande+json"
  ))
@

<<test functions>>=
