Fetches the education-instance (\emph{utbildningsinstans}) record for the given
UID.  An education instance represents an abstract programme or track
definition, as opposed to a specific round with an admission year.  The record
includes [[Utbildningskod]], [[Benamning]], and a hypermedia link array that
can point to subordinate instances.

