\section{[[utbildningsinstans_underliggande_JSON]]}

Returns the list of subordinate (\emph{underliggande}) education instances for
a given parent instance.  Used to enumerate the master specialisation options
and track options that belong to a programme instance.  Each element is a
minimal \texttt{\{"Uid": "..."\}} dict; call [[utbildningsinstans_JSON]] to
retrieve the full record.

<<LadokSession data methods>>=
def utbildningsinstans_underliggande_JSON(self, inst_uid: str) -> list:
  """Return subordinate education-instance UIDs for a parent instance.

  Uses GET /utbildningsinformation/internal/utbildningsinstans/
  underliggande?uid={uid}.

  Each element in the returned list is a minimal dict with at least
  {'Uid': '<uuid>'}.  Fetch the full record with utbildningsinstans_JSON.
  """
  data = self.get_query(
    f"/utbildningsinformation/internal/utbildningsinstans"
    f"/underliggande?uid={inst_uid}",
    "application/vnd.ladok-utbildningsinformation+json",
  )
  try:
    return data["Utbildningsinstans"]
  except KeyError as err:
    err.add_note(f"Response data: {data}")
    raise LadokAPIError(
      f"Unexpected response format when fetching subordinate "
      f"education instances for {inst_uid}: missing "
      f"'Utbildningsinstans' key"
    ) from err
@

A leaf course instance has no subordinates and returns an empty list;
a programme instance returns its tracks/specialisations.  We don't
assert a particular length --- only that the response unwraps cleanly
to a list.
